legend right
  |= Line |= Meaning |
  | solid arrow | compile-time dependency / call |
  | dashed arrow ..|> | implements a port |
  | dotted arrow ..> | used only by tests |
  | (x.spec) | spec file whose assertions describe this component |
  | via x.spec | no own spec — assertions live in the named spec |
  | .puml alias | stable anchor the document text may cite |
endlegend

